--TEST--
the `use` keyword names no symbol, so renaming there is refused, `rule:ide/no-refactoring-introduces-an-alias`
--FILE--
<?nvs
require 'lib/user.nvs';

us<|>e Shop\User;

var $u = new User();
--FILE lib/user.nvs--
<?nvs
namespace Shop;

class User
{
    public string $name = "";
}
--REQUEST--
rename to=Customer
--EXPECT--
refused: There is nothing to rename here. You can rename a class, a variable, a method, a property, a constant or an enum case.
